    "- FinBERT was trained on financial **news**, not central bank language. \"Negative\" here means negative sentiment, **not** the same as \"hawkish\" or \"dovish\".\n",
    "- Sentences are scored separately, without context.\n",
    "- Only the first 250 sentences of each PDF are scored, to keep it fast.\n",
    "\n",
